{"id":"HST77","text":"Harvest","description":"Harvest by region, crop, unit and time","unit":"-","suppressedDataValue":"0","updated":"2025-09-08T08:00:00","active":false,"contacts":[{"name":"Martin Lundø","phone":"+4551461512","mail":"mlu@dst.dk"}],"documentation":{"id":"31f48a74-30d5-4839-841f-c42ce9d54c9d","url":"https://www.dst.dk/documentationofstatistics/31f48a74-30d5-4839-841f-c42ce9d54c9d"},"footnote":{"text":"Maize to maturity, field peas and triticale have some sampling uncertainty. Winter and spring rapeseed are no longer calculated separately, as spring rapeseed constitutes less than 1% of the total rapeseed area. The area for Grass, green fodder and residues in total is excl. residues in 2006-2013. The harvest 1990-2015 is covered in table HST6, but without regional breakdown. 1920-1981 is covered in table HST1920 for selected crops. Other years in Statistical Yearbook. HST77 is replaced by two tables from the production year 2025 onwards. HST88 includes harvests of cereals, rapeseed and legumes. Preliminary figures are published in November of the production year and final figures in March of the following year. GROV88 includes roughage and is normally published in March of the year following the production year.","mandatory":false},"variables":[{"id":"OMRÅDE","text":"region","elimination":true,"time":false,"map":"Denmark_region_07","values":[{"id":"000","text":"All Denmark"},{"id":"084","text":"Region Hovedstaden"},{"id":"15","text":"Provinces Byen København, Københavns omegn and Nordsjælland"},{"id":"04","text":"Province Bornholm"},{"id":"085","text":"Region Sjælland"},{"id":"083","text":"Region Syddanmark"},{"id":"07","text":"Province Fyn"},{"id":"08","text":"Province Sydjylland"},{"id":"082","text":"Region Midtjylland"},{"id":"09","text":"Province Østjylland"},{"id":"10","text":"Province Vestjylland"},{"id":"081","text":"Region Nordjylland"}]},{"id":"AFGRØDE","text":"crop","elimination":false,"time":false,"values":[{"id":"H100","text":"CEREALS (GRAI